    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 11.04,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Therefore, the results of the assessments showed that the majority of the experts believed that the module was valid according to the study population and objectives. However, the essential changes were applied based on the experts’ recommendation such as improving the activities details and steps, adding picture to the module as well as highlighting the target life skill(s) in each session."
  }, {
